{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667600/extras/FloralDesign.gif?t=1749886040\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Manage a flower shop, design bouquets... with a talking flower on your head?!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Puni the Florist</strong> is a cozy flower shop simulation game where you play as &quot;Puni,&quot; an office worker-turned-florist. Run a flower shop, design bouquets, and deal with a weird talking flower that grows on her head.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">This demo includes:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A glimpse into <strong>Puni\u2019s backstory</strong> and her first day as a florist</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Floral design gameplay</strong> with extensive customization\u00a0options</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>60+</strong> flower variants, greenery, props, and containers to mix and match</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>4 unique bouquet requests</strong> from quirky townsfolk</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A relaxing <strong>Sandbox Mode</strong> to freely create your own floral designs</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667600/extras/Lobby.gif?t=1749886040\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3667600?t=1749886040","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667600/c3dcce7eca2fec19f11df6f22b19c6403aab8219/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749886040","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667600/356a2f1f5fc383663398cbe7cad14cd831e643e8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749886040","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667600/356a2f1f5fc383663398cbe7cad14cd831e643e8/capsule